# Public production domain (no trailing slash). Single source of truth for:
#   - app/layout.jsx        -> metadataBase (root metadata export)
#   - app/sitemap.js        -> every <loc> in sitemap.xml
#   - app/robots.js         -> the Sitemap: line in robots.txt
#   - app/salons/[id], app/artists/[id], app/shops/[id] -> alternates.canonical
#
# If unset, all of the above fall back to the placeholder
# "https://zibaban.example.com" so local dev / CI never breaks — but this
# MUST be set to the real zibaban domain in production, otherwise every URL
# submitted to Google (and every canonical/OG tag) will point at a fake host.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://zibaban.example.com
